  "reader_scope": "The complete manuscripts in Parts 4--8 construct and relate the stated Gamma cyclic spectral representation, amplitude windows and configuration observable and operator-algebra maps. That Gamma cyclic representation does not reconstruct local interacting Yang--Mills theory. Retaining the full origin amplitude window adds a zero-energy sector beyond the single vacuum. The original Hamiltonians, hypotheses and limiting scopes are given in full in the manuscripts below. The supplied checker distinguishes exact algebra identities from separately labelled numerical illustrations. The subsequent interaction notes retain the full original electric and Wilson operator coefficients, a controlled fixed-box vacuum expansion, and the six-dimensional first physical gap matrix. These fixed-box corrections do not establish a regulator-uniform interacting continuum or its mass-gap failure.",
